    "content" : "C[t−i 1t1(1 + ξiξ1),...,t−i 1,...,t−i 1tn(1 + ξiξn),t−i 1t1(ξi − ξ1),...,t−i 1ξi,...,t−i 1tn(ξi − ξn)], so the supervariety is decidedly not isomorphic to projective superspace. Figure 4(B) depicts corresponding decorated fan for n = 1."
