    "content" : "The prior example admitted no issues of compatibility between different rays of the same cone. This is not ordinarily the case; if ρ1 = R+(a1x1 + ... + anxn) and ρ2 = R+(b1x1 + ... + bnxn), compatibility is less common if the linear matroid on the n vectors"
